---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {siteImage} from '../data/siteImages';
import PentaVisual from './PentaVisual.astro';

import ContactIcon from './ContactIcon.astro';
import AboutRedesignPhoto from './AboutRedesignPhoto.astro';
import {qualificationEmail,visitEmail} from '../data/aboutEditorial';
import '../styles/about-approved.css';
import '../styles/about-constitution.css';
import '../styles/content-image-led.css';
---
<Layout title="Contact LZZ Precision in Hangzhou" description="Email or WhatsApp LZZ Precision about custom CNC parts. Find the Hangzhou address, prepare a drawing-based inquiry or arrange a workshop visit." cta={false}>
 <article class="ar-page ar-contact rd-wrap rd-page">
  <section class="ar-contact-opening" data-core-section="Direct contact and new part inquiry"><div class="ar-contact-opening-inner">
   <header class="ar-contact-summary"><h1>Contact LZZ</h1><p>Talk to us about a new part, an existing order or the documents you need for a supplier review.</p>
    <dl class="ar-contact-channels"><div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:roger@lzz-cnc.com"><ContactIcon kind="email"/>roger@lzz-cnc.com</a></dd></div><div><dt>WhatsApp</dt><dd><a href="https://wa.me/8613858102479"><ContactIcon kind="phone"/>+86 138 5810 2479</a></dd></div><div><dt>Location &amp; time zone</dt><dd>Hangzhou, China · UTC+8</dd></div></dl>
   </header>
   <section class="ar-contact-primary" aria-labelledby="al-inquiry-title">
    <PentaVisual image={siteImage('home-drawing-review')} eager sizes="(max-width:767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 570px"/>
    <div><h2 id="al-inquiry-title">A new part</h2><p>Send the current drawing and model, material, finish and quantity. Mark the critical features and inspection records you need, along with the destination and requested arrival date.</p><nav class="ar-links" aria-label="New part enquiry"><a class="rd-button" href="/quote/">Request a quote</a><a href="/resources/ordering/rfq-checklist/">RFQ checklist</a></nav><p class="ar-note">Review the draft, attach drawings and send it from your email app.</p></div>
   </section>
  </div></section>
  <section class="ar-contact-support-row" data-core-section="Existing order support"><PentaVisual image={siteImage('home-project-support')}/><div><h2>An existing order</h2><p>For an order change, acceptance question or part discrepancy, send the drawing revision and order or batch reference. Include the affected quantity and any photographs or measurements that help explain the issue.</p><nav class="ar-links" aria-label="Existing order support"><a href="mailto:roger@lzz-cnc.com">Email LZZ</a><a href="/about/how-we-work/#section-2">Order and after-sales responsibilities</a></nav></div></section>
  <section class="ar-contact-document-row" data-core-section="Supplier documents" id="al-contact-support"><h2>Supplier documents</h2><div><p>Request the current ISO 9001 certificate and scope. Identify any order-specific reports or material documents your team needs.</p><nav class="ar-links" aria-label="Supplier documents"><a href={qualificationEmail}>Request supplier documents</a><a href="/about/company-profile/#documents">View the document archive</a></nav></div></section>
  <section data-core-section="Workshop visit" class="ar-contact-visit" aria-labelledby="al-location-title"><AboutRedesignPhoto id="workshop-wide" caption="LZZ machining workshop · Hangzhou"/><div><h2 id="al-location-title">Visit the workshop</h2><p>Contact us before travelling so we can agree a date and the parts or processes you would like to discuss.</p><address class="ar-address">Hangzhou Lizhizao Precision Machinery Co., Ltd.<br/>No. 4 Fengcheng Road, Pingyao<br/>Yuhang District, Hangzhou<br/>Zhejiang, China</address><a class="ar-text-link" href={visitEmail}>Arrange a workshop visit</a></div></section>
 </article>
</Layout>
